(6587994, 982780, 14867, '<td valign="top">Pure jewel, though not DPC-friendly. The muted colors, the slight overexposure, the contrast and grain are combining for a modern and creative image, both very original and perfectly balanced according the classical rules.</td>', 'Pure jewel, though not DPC-friendly. The muted colors, the slight overexposure, the contrast and grain are combining for a modern and creative image, both very original and perfectly balanced according the classical rules.', '2011-11-07 16:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
