(6590222, 982600, 101668, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject and reflection. The many pieces on the mantlepiece don''t enhance the overall. Little dark too at the top but very nice scene. 6</td>', 'Interesting subject and reflection. The many pieces on the mantlepiece don''t enhance the overall. Little dark too at the top but very nice scene. 6', '2011-11-09 03:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
