(6590226, 982745, 101668, '<td valign="top">Line at the bottom right a little distracting and to me lacks the wow factor. Good lighting 6</td>', 'Line at the bottom right a little distracting and to me lacks the wow factor. Good lighting 6', '2011-11-09 04:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6590228, 982663, 101668, '<td valign="top">In every picture one''ll find right angles which, in my mind should be square. There are more curves in this than right angles but it is a simple and effective picture of a sunny scene. Technics good and for that I give it a 7</td>', 'In every picture one''ll find right angles which, in my mind should be square. There are more curves in this than right angles but it is a simple and effective picture of a sunny scene. Technics good and for that I give it a 7', '2011-11-09 04:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
