(6590872, 982524, 64446, '<td valign="top">Indeed, a very good composition, Mita. The more I see, the more I like it. Love the colors nuances and tones - and 110% fits the challenge. Well done!</td>', 'Indeed, a very good composition, Mita. The more I see, the more I like it. Love the colors nuances and tones - and 110% fits the challenge. Well done!', '2011-11-09 17:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
