(6590881, 982723, 64446, '<td valign="top">Nice skies, interesting comp... a site for consideration for the "Door, gates,..." challenge.</td>', 'Nice skies, interesting comp... a site for consideration for the "Door, gates,..." challenge.', '2011-11-09 17:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6590882, 982615, 64446, '<td valign="top">Great find!</td>', 'Great find!', '2011-11-09 17:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6590885, 982419, 114225, '<td valign="top">This is really cool! I like the way you composed and processed the shot.<br/> <br/>Note that there is some chromatic aberration in here, which is taking a touch of the professionalism out. You can see is as a pink line where the buildings on the left meet the sky. This is easily removed in post processing.<br/> <br/>But overall, I think this is still a great photo.</td>', 'This is really cool! I like the way you composed and processed the shot. Note that there is some chromatic aberration in here, which is taking a touch of the professionalism out. You can see is as a pink line where the buildings on the left meet the sky. This is easily removed in post processing. But overall, I think this is still a great photo.', '2011-11-09 17:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6591009, 982419, 136989, '<td valign="top">Looks very surreal, like a painting ... very nice!</td>', 'Looks very surreal, like a painting ... very nice!', '2011-11-09 20:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6591010, 982317, 136989, '<td valign="top">My personal favorite in this challenge.  The color and detail are great and the rectangle is spot on.</td>', 'My personal favorite in this challenge.  The color and detail are great and the rectangle is spot on.', '2011-11-09 20:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6591011, 982723, 136989, '<td valign="top">The colors really pull this one together for me.  Great shot!</td>', 'The colors really pull this one together for me.  Great shot!', '2011-11-09 20:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6591013, 982798, 136989, '<td valign="top">It''s a tad busy but great colors and ya can''t question the right angles.</td>', 'It''s a tad busy but great colors and ya can''t question the right angles.', '2011-11-09 20:19:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6591014, 982575, 136989, '<td valign="top">The center section is very nice ... the large blurry border, while great in color, is hard to look at.</td>', 'The center section is very nice ... the large blurry border, while great in color, is hard to look at.', '2011-11-09 20:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6591015, 982787, 136989, '<td valign="top">I like the color in the glass and contrast with the wood.  Would prefer the lines to be square though (of course that assumes the door is square/straight too!)</td>', 'I like the color in the glass and contrast with the wood.  Would prefer the lines to be square though (of course that assumes the door is square/straight too!)', '2011-11-09 20:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6591016, 982537, 136989, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, colors and use of shadows for framing. Facial expression fits the introspective title. :) For some odd reason the front foot stands out and catches my eye.  It just looks out of proportion ...</td>', 'Nice composition, colors and use of shadows for framing. Facial expression fits the introspective title. :) For some odd reason the front foot stands out and catches my eye.  It just looks out of proportion ...', '2011-11-09 20:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6591017, 982721, 136989, '<td valign="top">More elbow and less glaring white table would have made this work better for me.</td>', 'More elbow and less glaring white table would have made this work better for me.', '2011-11-09 20:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6591018, 982507, 136989, '<td valign="top">Points for creativity.  :) Nice colors but does not look appetizing to me.</td>', 'Points for creativity.  :) Nice colors but does not look appetizing to me.', '2011-11-09 20:27:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6591020, 982722, 136989, '<td valign="top">I probably would have cropped in to just capture the in focus section.  The angles there are great while the left is blurred and distracting.</td>', 'I probably would have cropped in to just capture the in focus section.  The angles there are great while the left is blurred and distracting.', '2011-11-09 20:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6591021, 982438, 136989, '<td valign="top">Wow there is A LOT going on here.  Boosting a point in second pass due to the pleasing colors.</td>', 'Wow there is A LOT going on here.  Boosting a point in second pass due to the pleasing colors.', '2011-11-09 20:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6591216, 982666, 131841, '<td valign="top">simple and genius.</td>', 'simple and genius.', '2011-11-10 00:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6591407, 982715, 93565, '<td valign="top">Very cool image.<br/>Total nitpicking here- there''s something odd about the left side of the frame and a portion of the bottom of the frame. The tone is different for some reason.<br/>Great shot though.</td>', 'Very cool image.Total nitpicking here- there''s something odd about the left side of the frame and a portion of the bottom of the frame. The tone is different for some reason.Great shot though.', '2011-11-10 10:50:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6591408, 982809, 93565, '<td valign="top">Because the texture of the clockface is so cool, I''d like to have seen your depth of field extend through the entire image.</td>', 'Because the texture of the clockface is so cool, I''d like to have seen your depth of field extend through the entire image.', '2011-11-10 10:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6591410, 982615, 93565, '<td valign="top">Sweet abstract you''ve got here. The sky almost didn''t make me initially think sky. I''m not sure if I really like the open window or dislike it''s presence, but it''s a very prominent part of the photo once you''ve looked at it for a bit. Either way, really cool.</td>', 'Sweet abstract you''ve got here. The sky almost didn''t make me initially think sky. I''m not sure if I really like the open window or dislike it''s presence, but it''s a very prominent part of the photo once you''ve looked at it for a bit. Either way, really cool.', '2011-11-10 10:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6591411, 982605, 93565, '<td valign="top">Very nice way of bringing the human form into this challenge. Nice, subtle lighting. This has njsabs written on it.</td>', 'Very nice way of bringing the human form into this challenge. Nice, subtle lighting. This has njsabs written on it.', '2011-11-10 10:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
